DTSTAMP:20260814T042946Z
DTSTART:20260814T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nYannis Pappas LIVE at Punch Line Philly\nGet ready
	 for a hilarious night as comedian Yannis Pappas takes the stage at Punch 
	Line Philly in Philadelphia on August 14\, 2026. Known for his razor-sharp
	 wit\, relatable storytelling\, and explosive energy\, Yannis delivers a s
	tand-up experience that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nE
	vent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 1
	 hour before show)\nVenue: Punch Line Philly\nAddress: 33 E. Laurel Street
	\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123\nAge Requirement: 21+ with valid government-iss
	ued photo ID (18+ with parent or legal guardian over 30)\nParking: Lot N: 
	49 Richmond Street | Lot S: 1025 N. Front Street\nDrink Minimum: 2-beverag
	e minimum per person \nAbout Yannis Pappas\nYannis Pappas is a New York-ba
